---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /about/portraits/
title: Portraits
wide: true
description: "Portraits of Wayne Martin Mellinger, Ph.D., in several mediums: paintings, illustrations and photographs."
breadcrumbs:
  - { label: "About", url: "/about/" }
---
<header class="page-head">
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>Portraits</h1>
  <p class="lede">Portraits, in several mediums.</p>
</header>
<ul class="gallery">
  {%- for img in images.gallery %}
  <li class="gallery-item{% if img.height > img.width * 1.2 %} tall{% endif %}">
    <figure>
      {%- set sizes = "(min-width: 64rem) 30rem, (min-width: 40rem) 45vw, 92vw" %}{% set eager = loop.first %}
      {% include "picture.njk" %}
      {%- if img.credit %}<figcaption>{{ img.credit }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
    </figure>
  </li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
